{"D:\\wt\\sgardenmole\\vlog\\sgardenmole\\voz\\b000_t2.wav": {"text": "a small bottle of castor oil, a jar of garlic, and a bowl of old coffee grounds. That is what my mother used to send the moles away from her garden in Osaka. No poison, no traps, never once. And last week a man in a truck came to my neighbor's lawn, walked around the mounds for 15 minutes, and asked her for $400. $400. Come, sit with me on the back step. I will show you what my mother did instead and why it still works in an American yard 50 years later. You know the feeling. You open the back door in the morning and there they are. Little brown hills of fresh dirt in the middle of your nice grass. Five, six, ten of them, like somebody buried a row of cats overnight. Soft lines under the lawn that sink when you step on them. Your tulip bed pushed up and dry. You flatten the hills with a shovel, and the next morning there are new ones.", "words": [{"w": " a", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.1}, {"w": " small", "s": 0.1, "e": 0.54}, {"w": " bottle", "s": 0.54, "e": 0.94}, {"w": " of", "s": 0.94, "e": 1.24}, {"w": " castor", "s": 1.24, "e": 1.68}, {"w": " oil,", "s": 1.68, "e": 2.62}, {"w": " a", "s": 2.62, "e": 2.64}, {"w": " jar", "s": 2.64, "e": 2.82}, {"w": " of", "s": 2.82, "e": 3.0}, {"w": " garlic,", "s": 3.0, "e": 3.82}, {"w": " and", "s": 3.82, "e": 3.86}, {"w": " a", "s": 3.86, "e": 4.0}, {"w": " bowl", "s": 4.0, "e": 4.22}, {"w": " of", "s": 4.22, "e": 4.44}, {"w": " old", "s": 4.44, "e": 4.8}, {"w": " coffee", "s": 4.8, "e": 5.16}, {"w": " grounds.", "s": 5.16, "e": 6.06}, {"w": " That", "s": 6.2, "e": 6.36}, {"w": " is", "s": 6.36, "e": 6.52}, {"w": " what", "s": 6.52, "e": 6.68}, {"w": " my", "s": 6.68, "e": 6.84}, {"w": " mother", "s": 6.84, "e": 7.18}, {"w": " used", "s": 7.18, "e": 7.44}, {"w": " to", "s": 7.44, "e": 7.66}, {"w": " send", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.86}, {"w": " the", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.08}, {"w": " moles", "s": 8.08, "e": 8.38}, {"w": " away", "s": 8.38, "e": 8.68}, {"w": " from", "s": 8.68